// Phosphor icons (ui/icons/README.md), by name: "chats", "magnifying-glass", … Regular for the
// Workbench and Terminal themes, duotone for Broadsheet; widgets.slint's Icon picks one and tints it.
// Generated from the files in ui/icons/: to add an icon, download both weights and add a line to each
// function.

